B.caX=new A.pv("Micropreemie","Micro-LBW","<750 g","Birthweight below 750 g \u2014 extreme end of the extremely-low birth weight spectrum.","Highest risk of mortality, IVH, NEC, BPD, ROP, and long-term neurodevelopmental impairment. Requires tertiary NICU care with surfactant, early CPAP/mechanical ventilation, and parenteral nutrition from Day 1.",B.m3,null,749)
B.cb0=new A.pv("Extremely Low Birth Weight","ELBW","<1000 g","Birthweight below 1000 g regardless of gestational age.","Very high risk of respiratory distress syndrome, IVH, NEC, sepsis, and PDA. Surfactant, early TPN, antenatal steroids, and strict fluid/glucose management required. Long-term neurodevelopmental follow-up mandatory.",B.ab,null,999)
B.caY=new A.pv("Very Low Birth Weight","VLBW","1000\u20131499 g","Birthweight 1000 g or more but less than 1500 g.","High risk of RDS, PDA, and IVH. Most require NICU admission for respiratory support, early nutrition, and glucose/thermal regulation. Better short-term survival than ELBW but similar risk categories.",B.ax,1000,1499)
