B.bpM=s(["The fetus is now considered to be early term.","The average 37-week fetus is 19 inches (48.3 cm) long and weighs 6.7 pounds (3028 grams).","The average 38-week fetus is 19.4 inches (49.2 cm) long and weighs 7.1 pounds (3236 grams).","The proximal humeral epiphysis ossification center may be seen at 38 weeks."],t.s)
B.cc0=new A.ik(B.xX,"Proximal humeral epiphysis ossification center may be seen at 38 weeks.")
